start: mr
R1: 2ch 12dc@ring ss@top
R2: ch sc@same 3ch sc [sc 3ch sc]x5 ss@top
R3: sl@sp 2ch {3dc 3ch 3dc}@same [{3dc 3ch 3dc}@sp]x5 ss@top
R4: 3sl sl@sp sc@same 7ch [sc@sp 7ch]x5 ss@top
R5: ch sc@same [8sc@sp sc]x2 9sc@sp sc [8sc@sp sc]x2 9sc@sp ss@top
R6: ch 2sc 3hdc 2dc {dc 3ch dc}@st [2dc 3hdc 3sc 3hdc 2dc {dc 3ch dc}@st]x3 2dc 3hdc sc ss@top
R7: 2ch 2dc@same [sk 2dc@st]x3 sk {2dc 3ch 2dc}@corner [[sk 2dc@st]x7 sk {2dc 3ch 2dc}@corner]x3 [sk 2dc@st]x3 sk ss@top
R8-9: ch 2sk [2dc@sp 2sk]>corner [{2dc 3ch 2dc}@corner [2dc@sp 2sk]>corner]x3 {2dc 3ch 2dc}@corner [2dc@sp 2sk]>end ss@top
R10: ch [[hdc]>corner {2hdc 2ch 2hdc}@corner]x4 ss@top
